Z||000032||Seanh||04-13-2001||09:58 PM||||Are those 5.25" or 6.5" speaks in the doors? Just curious. Iv got 6.5's in the kickpanels, but this door panel setup looks a little nicer IMO. (Its just a shame your beautiful installation was ruined by those <BR>Sony Xplod speakers in there) Just kiddin, they should sound pretty descent. But, honestly, If I went to all the work to make an installation look that clean and custom, I woulda used alot higher-end speakers. Where are you amps, if any, mounted?<P>That interior looks sweet! I wished I wouldn't have backed out of the idea for a red interior now, I went 2-tone gray leather and vinyl.||||reg||1
